  "question": {
    "text": "Electric field of a plane electromagnetic wave propagating through a non-magnetic medium is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The dielectric constant of the medium is equal to:<br />(Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>)</mo></math>"
  },
