  "solution": {
    "text": "Equate the wave equation with the equation of EM wave,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;here&nbsp;the given equation of EM wave,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />The refractive index,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub></msqrt><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mtext>given</mtext><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>"
